UPDATE "Service" SET "pipelineConfig" = $json$[{"id":"step_1","blockSlug":"photo-2017","input":"{{user.person1}}","params":{"model":{"standard":"gpt-image-2","pro":"gpt-image-2"},"image_urls":["{{user.person2}}"],"output_format":"jpg","aspect_ratio":"{{user.aspect}}","resolution":"4K","quality":"high","prompt_one":"GPT Image 2 edit. Use the uploaded photo ONLY as a face and identity reference. THE SINGLE MOST IMPORTANT REQUIREMENT: reproduce this exact person with perfect, undistorted facial likeness — identical face shape and bone structure, identical eyes, eyebrows, nose, mouth, lips, jawline, chin, ears, hairline, hairstyle, hair color, skin tone, age and unique facial proportions. The face must be an exact match to the reference, instantly recognizable as the same person. Do NOT stylize, smooth, beautify, re-age, slim, widen, morph, warp or change the face in any way, and do NOT turn it into a generic or different person. Only borrow the identity — do not copy the original photo's pose, framing, clothing or background.\n\nCreate a brand new, high-quality, atmospheric photo set in the CIS / post-Soviet summer of 2016-2017 (the nostalgic VK era). It should have the quality and mood of a well-shot 2016-2017 video, but be a NATURAL, BELIEVABLE photograph — not an over-stylized or blurred cinematic composite, and not an amateur phone snapshot. It feels candid and real, as if a photographer captured the person from a few meters away, never a selfie.\n\nMANDATORY wardrobe change: dress the person in authentic 2016-2017 raion (двор) street style. Pick a believable combination: an adidas-style retro track jacket (олимпийка) with side stripes, OR a Thrasher-style flame-logo hoodie, OR a plain dark hoodie or tracksuit top; paired with dark tracksuit pants or fitted jeans and white sneakers; optionally a cap, beanie or small shoulder bag (барсетка). The outfit must clearly read as 2016-2017 CIS youth streetwear. Never keep the original clothing.\n\nScene: an ordinary post-Soviet courtyard at dusk. Grey panel apartment blocks (панельки / хрущёвки) in the background, asphalt, a bench, metal garages, workout bars (турники), old parked cars, a simple playground. A strong малиновый закат: a deep crimson-magenta-purple sunset gradient glowing behind the buildings, warm low backlight, long soft shadows.\n\nLIGHTING AND COLOR (critical): one coherent light and color situation — warm crimson-magenta sunset light plus soft cool dusk ambient, rich but natural contrast and a tasteful color grade. Light, color-grade AND focus the person to truly belong to this scene: warm rim/edge light on the hair, cheek and shoulders from the glowing sky, soft natural fill on the face, and the SAME white balance, color temperature, exposure, grade, focus and grain as the environment. The person must look genuinely shot in this courtyard at this moment — never a pasted, cut-out, sticker or composited look, and never lit, graded or focused differently from the scene.\n\nFraming and pose: a candid three-quarter shot framed from the head down to roughly the knees or mid-thigh - NOT a tiny distant full-body figure and NOT a tight face close-up. The person stands or leans casually in the yard against the sunset and the panelki, slightly off-center, relaxed and natural - hands in pockets or loosely at the sides, calm confident posture, looking at the camera or slightly away. Not a stiff model pose, no outstretched arm, no phone in hand, no mirror.\n\nANATOMY AND PROPORTIONS (critical): render fully correct, natural human anatomy and realistic body proportions of a real photographed person. The head must be in correct, realistic proportion to the neck, shoulders and body, with normal shoulder width, natural torso and limb length and a relaxed natural posture. No oversized or undersized head, no shrunken, stretched or elongated body, no wrong head-to-body ratio, no warped or melted proportions, no distorted limbs or hands.\n\nLook and quality: a high-quality, sharp, detailed real photograph with rich but natural contrast, deep crimson sunset colors and genuine dusk atmosphere, as if shot on a good camera. Keep the WHOLE frame in natural deep focus: the panel buildings, sky, garages and yard behind the person must stay sharp and clearly readable. Do NOT use shallow depth of field, background blur or bokeh — the person and the environment share the same crisp focus, light and grain, so the person clearly belongs in the scene and never looks cut out or photoshopped onto a blurred backdrop. Photorealistic and believable, with realistic skin texture and pores, natural hair and fabric — not plastic, not waxy, not over-retouched, not an over-stylized cinematic render.\n\nAvoid: shallow depth of field, background blur, bokeh, blurred or out-of-focus background, cut-out, composited or photoshopped look, over-stylized or fake cinematic render, distorted, warped, asymmetric or melted faces, a face that does not match the reference, identity drift, stylized or cartoonish faces, plastic or waxy AI skin, heavy beauty filter, over-smoothing, deformed or extra hands, wrong head-to-body ratio, elongated or shrunken body, a face lit or focused differently from the scene, extra people, duplicated faces, selfie framing, close-up face crop, outstretched arm, phone or mirror in frame, text, captions, logos or watermarks.","prompt_two":"GPT Image 2 edit. You are given EXACTLY TWO reference images; each one is a separate real person. THE SINGLE MOST IMPORTANT REQUIREMENT: reproduce BOTH people with perfect, undistorted facial likeness, each taken from their OWN reference image — identical face shape and bone structure, eyes, eyebrows, nose, mouth, lips, jawline, chin, hairline, hairstyle, hair color, skin tone, age and unique facial proportions. Each face must be an exact match to its own reference and instantly recognizable. Do NOT stylize, smooth, beautify, re-age, morph, warp or change either face; do NOT blend, average, mix or swap the two faces; do NOT duplicate either person; and do NOT invent extra people or add background faces.\n\nCreate one brand new, high-quality, atmospheric photo of EXACTLY TWO people together, set in the CIS / post-Soviet summer of 2016-2017 (the nostalgic VK era). It should have the quality and mood of a well-shot 2016-2017 video, but be a NATURAL, BELIEVABLE photograph — not an over-stylized or blurred cinematic composite, and not an amateur phone snapshot. It feels candid and real, as if a photographer captured them from a few meters away, never a selfie. The first person comes from the first reference image, the second person from the second reference image. They stand or sit close together, relaxed and natural, in an ordinary post-Soviet courtyard at dusk.\n\nMANDATORY wardrobe change for both: dress each person in authentic 2016-2017 raion (двор) street style - adidas-style retro track jackets (олимпийки) with side stripes, Thrasher-style flame-logo hoodies, plain dark hoodies or tracksuit tops, dark tracksuit pants or fitted jeans, white sneakers, optional caps or beanies. Vary the outfits naturally between the two. Never keep the original clothing.\n\nScene: grey panel apartment blocks (панельки / хрущёвки) in the background, asphalt, benches, metal garages, workout bars, old parked cars, a simple playground. A strong малиновый закат: a deep crimson-magenta-purple sunset gradient glowing behind the buildings, warm low backlight, long soft shadows.\n\nLIGHTING AND COLOR (critical): one coherent light and color situation — warm crimson-magenta sunset light plus soft cool dusk ambient, rich but natural contrast and a tasteful color grade. Light, color-grade AND focus BOTH people to truly belong to this scene: warm rim/edge light on hair, cheeks and shoulders from the glowing sky, soft natural fill on the faces, and the SAME white balance, color temperature, exposure, grade, focus and grain across both people and the background. Both must look genuinely shot together in this courtyard at this moment — never a pasted, cut-out, sticker or composited look, and neither face may be lit, graded or focused differently from the other or from the scene. Both people sit in the same focal plane and the same grade.\n\nFraming and pose: a candid shot framed from the heads down to roughly the knees or mid-thigh - NOT tiny distant full-body figures and NOT tight face close-ups. The two stand or sit casually together against the sunset and the panelki, slightly off-center, relaxed natural posture, hands in pockets or loosely at the sides, looking at the camera or slightly away. Not stiff model poses, no outstretched arm, no phone in hand, no mirror.\n\nANATOMY AND PROPORTIONS (critical): render fully correct, natural human anatomy and realistic body proportions of real photographed people. Each head must be in correct, realistic proportion to its neck, shoulders and body, with normal shoulder width, natural torso and limb length and a relaxed natural posture, and both people at consistent, believable scale relative to each other. No oversized or undersized heads, no wrong head-to-body ratio, no shrunken, stretched or elongated bodies, no warped or melted proportions, no distorted limbs or hands.\n\nLook and quality: a high-quality, sharp, detailed real photograph with rich but natural contrast, deep crimson sunset colors and genuine dusk atmosphere, as if shot on a good camera. Keep the WHOLE frame in natural deep focus: the panel buildings, sky, garages and yard behind the two must stay sharp and clearly readable. Do NOT use shallow depth of field, background blur or bokeh — the people and the environment share the same crisp focus, light and grain, so they clearly belong in the scene and never look cut out or photoshopped onto a blurred backdrop. Photorealistic and believable, with realistic skin texture and pores, natural hair and fabric — not plastic, not waxy, not over-retouched, not an over-stylized cinematic render.\n\nAvoid: shallow depth of field, background blur, bokeh, blurred or out-of-focus background, cut-out, composited or photoshopped look, over-stylized or fake cinematic render, distorted, warped, asymmetric or melted faces, a face that does not match its reference, identity drift, stylized or cartoonish faces, merged, swapped or duplicated faces, wrong number of people, plastic or waxy AI skin, heavy beauty filter, over-smoothing, deformed or extra hands, wrong head-to-body ratio, elongated or shrunken bodies, inconsistent scale between the two, a face lit or focused differently from the scene, selfie framing, outstretched arm, phone or mirror in frame, text, captions, logos or watermarks.","animate":"{{user.animate}}","video_model":"kling-3-pro","duration":5,"animation_prompt":"Bring this 2017 photo to life as a short, cinematic B-roll clip, like an establishing shot in a music video. The camera slowly drifts and glides past the scene with a smooth, steady slow dolly / parallax move, as if a videographer is filming a gentle fly-by. The person or people stay still and simply look calmly straight into the camera — almost no movement, only subtle micro-motion: slight natural blinking and faint breathing. Do NOT make them dance, gesture, walk, turn away or change pose or expression. The environment comes alive instead: wind gently moves their hair and clothes, trees, grass and bushes sway softly, the crimson-pink sunset clouds drift slowly, and the warm dusk light shimmers. Keep every face stable, sharp and exactly recognizable in every frame — no morphing, no identity drift, no face replacement, no warping of eyes, mouth or hands. Preserve the original composition, clothing, colours and the warm sunset lighting. Photorealistic, natural film-like motion, smooth, calm and steady."}}]$json$::jsonb WHERE slug = $q$single-photo-2017$q$;
